  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feed 150 vulnerable childrens from Belo Horizonte</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Centro de Acolhida Betania (CAB) welcomes children and adolescents with difficult backgrounds coming from the suburbs of Belo Horizonte, Brazil. We support these kids by offering them a place where they can learn, play and just be kids, as well as offering free psychological support to those in need. Many of the kids come from uncertain backgrounds and, therefore, a main mission of ours is to ensure that each kid at the CAB is offered two proper meals a day.</narrative>
  </description>
